The P4 Tree-sitter grammar was adapted from:
https://github.com/oxidecomputer/tree-sitter-p4
Author: Ryan Goodfellow
License: MPL-2.0 (see LICENSE)

The grammar has been substantially modified to follow the P4_16 v1.2.5
specification, expose named fields for semantic analysis, and support additional
declarations, expressions, and incomplete editor input. The generated WASM
parser is distributed with its corresponding grammar source in this extension.
